{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377340/extras/abb74d0d16e151a245482a1683417b80.poster.avif?t=1759259599\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377340/extras/abb74d0d16e151a245482a1683417b80.webm?t=1759259599\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377340/extras/abb74d0d16e151a245482a1683417b80.mp4?t=1759259599\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Delivery Guy Simulator</strong>, where you take on the streets of a vibrant city as a determined delivery guy! Navigate bustling city blocks, deliver all kinds of packages and rise to the top of the delivery business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377340/extras/c806b575df3772985c20ca8ff01db33c.webp?t=1759259599\" width=400 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on a variety of jobs! Whether it\u2019s hot food, fresh groceries, or important packages, deliver on time, earn big, and show everyone that you\u2019re the best in the business!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377340/extras/53a178fd189e46acab61cc12f1ce9f29.poster.avif?t=1759259599\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377340/extras/53a178fd189e46acab61cc12f1ce9f29.webm?t=1759259599\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377340/extras/53a178fd189e46acab61cc12f1ce9f29.mp4?t=1759259599\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377340/extras/b7a62e11cca9d6a89370f10a424f5425.webp?t=1759259599\" width=400 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose and unlock vehicles that fit your style. Earn money, buy new rides and upgrade them to take your delivery game to the next level!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377340/extras/10a911ac263fdd363223d4a9f9180393.poster.avif?t=1759259599\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377340/extras/10a911ac263fdd363223d4a9f9180393.webm?t=1759259599\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377340/extras/10a911ac263fdd363223d4a9f9180393.mp4?t=1759259599\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377340/extras/12660a8f7c5e8bf3ac82f2876cefd560.webp?t=1759259599\" width=400 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check your emails, pay your bills, shop online and play games. Manage your life on your personal computer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377340/extras/1089d1800f0b4a0f3ff132ff9eb149a3.poster.avif?t=1759259599\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377340/extras/1089d1800f0b4a0f3ff132ff9eb149a3.webm?t=1759259599\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377340/extras/1089d1800f0b4a0f3ff132ff9eb149a3.mp4?t=1759259599\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377340/extras/3ccd6334dded0c2a41661c66cd1ef41d.webp?t=1759259599\" width=400 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn your hustle into a full-fledged business! Rent a space, set up your operations and grow your busines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377340/extras/9c22557d6228b061806db9bbe3a9f462.poster.avif?t=1759259599\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377340/extras/9c22557d6228b061806db9bbe3a9f462.webm?t=1759259599\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377340/extras/9c22557d6228b061806db9bbe3a9f462.mp4?t=1759259599\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377340/extras/ca88d4ebaf9b2a0beaad1e02b2792910.webp?t=1759259599\" width=400 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on secret deliveries and discover a bigger role in dark side of the delivery business. No questions\u2014just deliver and explore a new path to the top. Are you ready for the challenge?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/s